{
  "claim_boundary": "Functional, cycle-accurate RTL of the communication engines (dispatch, expert port, combine, KV multicast node, carried argmax) between ot_rom_pkg_link instances under Verilator.  The links' CHANNEL_CYCLES is a delay-line stand-in for the PHY; the fabric between packages is the benches' own multicast demultiplexer and round-robin merge, not the RTL router; the expert COMPUTE is a behavioural model returning the golden's expert outputs (its inputs are checked against the golden).  Bit-exactness is of the MoE combine against tools/hdc_golden_v41 and of every delivered byte.",
